  "prefLabel": "Puc 1607.01 Effective Date of Special Contract",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 1607.01 Effective Date of Special Contract. A utility shall not provide service under a special contract until the commission has issued written approval of the terms of the proposed special contract pursuant to this part or by operation of RSA 378:18.\n\nSource. #6573, eff 9-10-97; ss and moved by #8428, eff 9-10-05 (from Puc 1606.02); ss by #10535, eff 3-4-14; ss by #14030, eff 7-25-24 (formerly Puc 1606.01)",
